industry.description:
👇Top 5 Weekly Crypto Fundraising | Feb 2 - Feb 8

1⃣ Anchorage - $100M
Institutional digital asset platform  @Anchorage raised $100M in a Strategic funding from @tether.

2⃣ TRM Labs - $70M
Blockchain intelligence & compliance platform @trmlabs raised $70M in a Series C  round led by 
@blockchaincap, with participation from @CMT_Digital, @goldmansachs,  @BessemerVP, @DRWTrading,  @ycombinator, @thomabravo, @alumniventures, @citi, @BHDigitalAssets and @galaxyhq.

3⃣ Jupiter - $35M
@JupiterExchange, Solana’s largest DEX aggregator, has secured a $35 million strategic investment from 
@paraficapital, settled entirely in JupUSD. 

4⃣ Prometheum - $ 23 M
@PrometheumInc, a SEC and FINRA-regulated, full-service market ecosystem for blockchain securities raised $23M

5⃣ Bluff - $21M
Social-centric betting entertainment platform @official_bluff raised $21M in a Strategic round led by @1kxnetwork, with participation from @makersfundvc, @mf__xyz and Tristan Thompson.

